        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Tōdai-ji</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">738 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Commissioned by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emperor-shomu">Emperor Shōmu</a> after a run of disasters and epidemics; the monk Gyōki and his pupils gathered donations, and the temple's records say more than 2,600,000 people contributed</span></div>
