          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">the Great Buddha (Daibutsu) of Vairocana; the Great Buddha Hall; the Nio guardians of the Great South Gate; the Shōsōin storehouse; ordination under the Vinaya; headquarters of the Kegon school</span></div>
